{"title":"26","section":"4084","heading":"Cross references","lead":"","tree":[{"marker":"(1)","path":"(1)","heading":"","text":"For provisions to relieve farmers from excise tax in the case of gasoline used on the farm for farming purposes, see section 6420.","children":[]},{"marker":"(2)","path":"(2)","heading":"","text":"For provisions to relieve purchasers of gasoline from excise tax in the case of gasoline used for certain nonhighway purposes, used by local transit systems, or sold for certain exempt purposes, see section 6421.","children":[]},{"marker":"(3)","path":"(3)","heading":"","text":"For provisions to relieve purchasers from excise tax in the case of taxable fuel not used for taxable purposes, see section 6427.","children":[]}],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"priorProvisions","text":"Prior ProvisionsA prior section 4084, added Apr. 2, 1956, ch. 160, § 4(a)(1), 70 Stat. 90; amended June 29, 1956, ch. 462, title II, § 208(e)(1), 70 Stat. 396, contained cross references, prior to the general amendment of this subpart by Pub. L. 99–514, § 1703(a). A prior section 4091, added Pub. L. 100–203, title X, § 10502(a), Dec. 22, 1987, 101 Stat. 1330–438; amended Pub. L. 100–203, title X, § 10502(g), Dec. 22, 1987, 101 Stat. 1330–446; Pub. L. 100–647, title II, § 2001(d)(6)(A)–(C), Nov. 10, 1988, 102 Stat. 3596; Pub. L. 101–508, title XI, §§ 11211(b)(1), (2), (6)(A), (B), (c)(4), (e)(4), 11213(b)(1), (2)(C), (D), (d)(2)(A), 11704(a)(38), Nov. 5, 1990, 104 Stat. 1388–424 to 1388–427, 1388–432, 1388–433, 1388–435, 1388–520; Pub. L. Pub. L. 102–240, title VIII, § 8002(a)(4), Dec. 18, 1991, 105 Stat. 2203; Pub. L. 103–66, title XIII, §§ 13241(b)(1), (2)(B)(i), (ii), 13242(a), Aug. 10, 1993, 107 Stat. 510, 518; Pub. L. 104–188, title I, § 1609(a)(1), Aug. 20, 1996, 110 Stat. 1841; Pub. L. 105–2, § 2(a)(1), Feb. 28, 1997, 111 Stat. 4; Pub. L. 105–34, title X, § 1031(a)(1), title XIV, § 1436(a), Aug. 5, 1997, 111 Stat. 929, 1053; Pub. L. 105–178, title IX, § 9003(a)(1)(D), (b)(2)("},{"topic":"statutoryNotes","text":"Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries"},{"topic":"effectiveDate","text":"Effective DateSection effective Jan. 1, 1994, see section 13242(e) of Pub. L. 103–66, set out as an Effective Date of 1993 Amendment note under section 4041 of this title."}],"sourceCredit":"(Added Pub. L. 103–66, title XIII, § 13242(a), Aug. 10, 1993, 107 Stat. 518.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 26—","heading":"INTERNAL REVENUE CODE","identifier":"/us/usc/t26"},{"type":"subtitle","num":"Subtitle D—","heading":"Miscellaneous Excise Taxes","identifier":"/us/usc/t26/stD"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 32—","heading":"MANUFACTURERS EXCISE TAXES","identifier":"/us/usc/t26/stD/ch32"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"Subchapter A—","heading":"Automotive and Related Items","identifier":"/us/usc/t26/stD/ch32/schA"},{"type":"part","num":"PART III—","heading":"PETROLEUM PRODUCTS","identifier":"/us/usc/t26/stD/ch32/schA/ptIII"},{"type":"subpart","num":"Subpart A—","heading":"Motor and Aviation Fuels","identifier":"/us/usc/t26/stD/ch32/schA/ptIII/sptA"}]}